                            <data value="Ugnaught" name="journalEntryTitle" />
                            <data value="&quot;As you destroy the last droid, the turbolift pings as it arrives. The Ugnaught dashes inside. As the doors begin to close, he throws you the canister of Tibanna Gas - which you barely manage to catch. Before you can process what's happening, the turbolift's doors have closed and the Ugnaught is gone.&quot;" name="journalEntryDescription" />
